                <span class="pl-pig-pill pl-pig-pill-ok">Confidence: high</span>
                <span class="pl-pig-pill">GitHub issue opened</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="pl-pig-ui-heading">Docs agents verify examples against the wrong product version.</h3>
              <dl class="pl-pig-fields">
                <div><dt>Instruction failure</dt><dd><code>review-docs</code> requires verifying examples but omits how to choose the documented version.</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Impact</dt><dd>Writers correct the version by hand, then wait for a second pass.</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Evidence</dt><dd>3 sessions with the same user correction</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pl-pig-panel" id="pig-step-panel-fix" data-pig-panel="fix" aria-labelledby="pig-step-tab-fix">
          <div class="pl-pig-ui">
            <div class="pl-pig-ui-bar">
              <span class="pl-pig-ui-title">Pull request · acme/instruction-hub → main</span>
              <span class="pl-pig-example-tag">Example</span>
            </div>
