                <li><span class="pl-pig-dot pl-pig-dot-ok" aria-hidden="true"></span><p><strong>Published</strong> a new plugin release through the hub’s workflow</p></li>
                <li><span class="pl-pig-dot pl-pig-dot-ok" aria-hidden="true"></span><p><strong>Verified</strong> on a pilot host: the next session checks the version before testing</p></li>
